	(text_box "Power Net Note\n* VIN: Pogo pin input port from USB port, expecting +5V or -5V, or 0V if not connected\n* VBUS: 5V (~4.8V after diode) from USB behind the reverse polarity protection, 0V if not connected\n* +BATT: Battery positive input. Expecting 3.7V - 4.2V, bi-directional, 0V if no battery is connected\n* +3V3: 3.3V output from power regulator\n* +3V3A: 3.3V output for high precision application"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 351.79 16.51 0)
		(size 53.34 33.02)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
